# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECTO_0000001> (exposure to radiation)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECTO_0000001> "A exposure event involving the interaction of an exposure receptor to radiation.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECTO_0000001> "exposure to radiation")
EquivalentClasses(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECTO_0000001> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ExO_0000002> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002309> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001023>)))
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECTO_0000001> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECTO_8000000>)
